se who disbelieve fight in the cause of ṭāghūt. So fight against the allies of Satan. Indeed, the plot of Satan has ever been weak.","j":5,"h":9,"s":4,"a":76,"sd":null},{"k":"4:77","t":"Have you not seen those who were told, \"Restrain your hands [from fighting] and establish prayer and give zakāh\"? But then when battle was ordained for them, at once a party of them feared men as they fear Allāh or with [even] greater fear. They said, \"Our Lord, why have You decreed upon us fighting? If only You had postponed [it for] us for a short time.\" Say, \"The enjoyment of this world is little, and the Hereafter is better for he who fears Allāh. And injustice will not be done to you, [even] as much as a thread [inside a date seed].\"","j":5,"h":9,"s":4,"a":77,"sd":null},{"k":"4:78","t":"Wherever you may be, death will overtake you, even if you should be within towers of lofty construction. But if good comes to them, they say, \"This is from Allāh\"; and if evil befalls them, they say, \"This is from you.\" Say, \"All [things] are from Allāh.\" So what is [the matter] with those people that they can hardly understand any statement?","j":5,"h":9,"s":4,"a":78,"sd":null},{"k":"4:79","t":"What comes to you of good is from Allāh, but what comes to you of evil, [O man], is from yourself. And We have sent you, [O Muḥammad], to the people as a messenger, and sufficient is Allāh as Witness.","j":5,"h":9,"s":4,"a":79,"sd":null}],"juz":5,"hizb":9,"surahs":[4],"sajdah":false}